{"id":"u-798d5a39-51d2-4730-aff2-098700b313dd","src":"community","title":"Summit Dynamics","author":"Nisarg Vyas","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/jqUit1-mountaineering-monk","desc":"The purpose of this 5-day Mountaineer Workout Program is to build a body and mind capable of conquering mountains — both literally and metaphorically. It’s designed for individuals like you who are gaining weight with purpose: to become not just bigger, but stronger, more resilient, and mountain-ready.\n\nThis program combines:\n\nBodybuilding to increase muscle mass and sculpt a powerful physique\n\nStrength training to prepare your body to carry loads across vertical terrain\n\nEndurance workouts to improve your aerobic capacity for long treks and high-altitude climbs\n\nHIIT circuits to simulate real-world bursts of effort under fatigue\n\nBalance and mobility work to keep you injury-free on rugged, unstable surfaces\n\nEvery element is intentional — not just to look fit, but to function like a mountaineer. Whether you're trekking through snowfields, climbing ridgelines, or carrying gear through forests and scree, this training prepares you from the inside out.\n\nUltimately, this program is not just about fitness. It’s about becoming the kind of person who pushes past limits, endures storms, and stands confidently on their own personal summits.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2025-07-19T08:18:09.274Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Hypertrophy - Muscle Gain","Strength Training","Endurance Training","HIIT Circuit","Balance & Mobility Training"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"am